Subject: [PATCH] [Qwen4Exp] Disk-offloaded PLE checkpoint rows

Upstream-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59958
Upstream-Commit: 396e7e0102896dda576dd1660fb64bc2f6ffd232
Base-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56273
Base-Commit: 4e0681ed5654c1d8afb3c104d4381afd08529de8
Integration-Base: 8084f0624dba24aba6ebac62d8e10cc00730a0fe

Refresh to the PR's disk_offload API, superseding the older #58815-based
host_file_gather integration. Read checkpoint rows with preadv into fixed
staging buffers, preserving upstream NVFP4 decoding and sequence parallelism.
Retain current upstream configuration, quantization imports and PLE tests.

